"Tāpirihia he pūkete mō ngā maramataka, ngā hoapā me ngā kōnae mā te tāuru i "
"tō tūmau WebDAV me ō taipitopito pūkete"

#: src/goabackend/goawebdavprovider.c:414
msgid "Server Addresses (Optional)"
msgstr "Ngā Wāhitau Tūmau (Kōwhiringa)"

#: src/goabackend/goawebdavprovider.c:415
